      "verse_no": 114,
      "translation": "When Plato began his philosophy, he pondered this thought, and thus came forth with this philosophical school of thought."
    },
    {
      "verse_no": 115,
      "translation": "And when Aristotle embraced this path, he deepened it, and many others followed him, until this thought and perspective emerged."
    },
    {
      "verse_no": 116,
      "translation": "Plato's and Aristotle's philosophies came to be, and Al-Farabi and Ibn Maskawayh contributed to them, and the growth of Aristotle's philosophy..."
    },
